%% Receipt hash chain. Explained in: docs/flows/Receipt_Flow.md
flowchart LR
    G[genesis] --> R1[receipt 1<br/>hash H1]
    R1 -->|prev = H1| R2[receipt 2<br/>hash H2]
    R2 -->|prev = H2| R3[receipt 3<br/>hash H3]
    R3 -->|prev = H3| HEAD[chain head]
    subgraph body[each receipt hashes]
        B[agent, tool, action, resource,<br/>source_trust, decision, approver,<br/>action_hash, prev_receipt_hash]
    end
    B -. aegis-jcs-1 + SHA-256 .-> R2
    SIG[Ed25519 signature<br/>over receipt_hash - optional] -.-> R2
